          "start_ms": null,
          "status": "needs-review",
          "text": "Description: Following the publication in regional press on March 18, 1997, of various reports of an unidentified aerial phenomenon (UAP) observed on March 17, 1997, a gendarmerie investigation is requested. Witnesses in several departments in southern France, as well as several air crews and a pilot performing training flights over the Mediterranean, reported observing, early in the morning, a very fast passing of a luminous phenomenon with a (green) color in the sky. The indicated trajectory was descending towards the Pyrenees. Various gendarmerie stations took statements from the witnesses. The descriptions from the witnesses correspond to a probable observation of a meteoroid atmospheric re-entry in the morning of March 17, 1997. Note that on the same day, but in the evening, other observations were reported to the gendarmerie: each corresponds to a different observation case (available on the GEIPAN site for this same date).",
          "translation_text_sha256": "004ccad2e8ef0cc5b3142a7989634c04bf4db42dab45f5813c2d6c318612743a"
        }
